<IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/profile_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Profile for Ghall Stohne"></A>  &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=private_message&u=00000003"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/priv_message.gif" BORDER='0' ALT="Send New Private Message"></A> &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=edit_post&f=1&t=000136&reply_num=000000&u=00000003"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/edit_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Edit/Delete Post"></A> &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=reply&f=1&t=000136&replyto=000000"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/quote_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Reply With Quote"></A>
</FONT>
<HR size="1" color="#5d7790">
<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
It was decided.  We were going back to the tower.  We knew that we had freed many sould from the grasp of that dark place just as we knew there were many more that needed to be set free.  We began to gather in West Commons while Gastro and Ghowen scouted the area near the tower.  When Brod, Brinne and Leaff had gathered at the druid ring in the commons we were wisked away to the Dreadlands to pick up Medec.  Once we 5 were gathered together, Leaff summond up her magics and moved us, once again, around the world to Velious's frozen tundra ... Ice Clad.  We met up with Gastro outside the tower, baed farewell to Ghowen and slipped into the tower.<P>Knowing that the first 3 floors had already been released, we went directly to the 4th floor, we headed right to the room in the center of the tower.  There we should have found a soul carrying the key to the 5th floor but alas she was not to be found.  We released many sould back into the void last night and some were kind enough to bless us with the last of their worldly possessions.<P>/ooc<P>We spent the entire night awaiting the spawn of the named mummy that drops the key to level 5, but she never did show.  At the end of the night we started roaming, instead of having Brod (master puller) bringing stuff to us.  Hunting the mobs b wandering was very much more exciting.  We learned that if we're prepared we could even drop into the pits on that floor and take the mobs down there.  Lots of exp was to be had and Brod dinged to 45.  Erlas is 4 blues away from 45.  Leaff and Brinne are on their way to 44.<P><BR>Once we hit 50, we can start going into places like Velks Labirynth, Old Sebelis, Karnors Castle, Skyshrine, Deeper into SolB, Deeper into Guk, Close to Vox's lair in Permafrost, Deeper into Kedge, Deeper into City of Mist, The Hole, Skyfire, burning woods and Chardok.  VERY Exciting stuff.<P>--------------------<P> <img src="http://people.mn.mediaone.net/raven13/images/Ghall.gif"> 
</FONT>
