<FONT SIZE="1" color="#a62a2a" face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
posted October 04, 2001 08:55 AM &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=get_profile&u=00000006" target=_blank>
<IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/profile_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Profile for Lownar/Kalaan/Rakasak"></A>  &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=private_message&u=00000006"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/priv_message.gif" BORDER='0' ALT="Send New Private Message"></A> &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=edit_post&f=1&t=000136&reply_num=000001&u=00000006"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/edit_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Edit/Delete Post"></A> &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=reply&f=1&t=000136&replyto=000001"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/quote_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Reply With Quote"></A>
</FONT>
<HR size="1" color="#5d7790">
<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Well, I didn't do much of anything last night.   <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  Logged on my necro mule on SolRo to get my pre-nerf Circlet of Shadows from Versers' mule (gonna give it to an old friend).  Logged back onto Bertox and headed to Iceclad to do a turn in at the gnomes for a quest, along the way I dropped off the Dragonhide Belt to Brod, and a Stalagterror Spine Spear to Leaff for Hieck.  <P>I then went to Crystal Caverns. The terrors AND the spiders were camped, so I just wandered around the caverns where the orcs are, looking for something to do.  I heard an herbalist casting, so I found a safe spot to summon a pet, and starting clearing mobs in search of him, finally found him near the Foreman spawn.  I killed him and looted a Crystal Covered Shroud, about that time the Foreman popped up, so I took him out and he dropped a frozen longsword (crappy), wandered back to the terror area and found a Life Leech up, took him out and he dropped a chipped velium amulet, then I wandered back to the foreman spawn, he was up again, this time he dropped his skullcap.  By that time I decided I should go finish the quest I'd started earlier in the evening, so I gated back to kael and turned in the note and got another set of Engraved Bone Pauldrons.  <P>After all that I decided to log back onto SolRo and see if my friend was online yet, he wasn't, but "Blood Tide" was camping Ragefire, so I ran up to SolB from Freeport, and snuck my way to Nagafens Lair, spent about 1.5 hours messing around with them, got bored, so I snuck back out of solb and camped.  Logged back on, gave some trade stuff to Vowk, got the CCS to my monk, then took vowk to EC and did some selling.   <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  Made 300pp off selling a mask, and another 300pp of selling the engraved bone pauldrons.   <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  The quest for the pauldrons is very easy, and yields a halfway decent item.  The quest to get the mask is easy also.  If you have a char that spends anytime getting exp in Velks, save the Ice kobold paws, they are light, and stackable.  I can turn them in for faction, 4 at a time, and randomly get back 1 of 2 masks.  Either a silvery mask, or an antlered mask.  If you all save up your paws, and let me turn them in for faction, I'll give you the masks.   <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  If you have any friends that aren't on giant faction, but end up looting paws, let them know, I'll do the same thing for them.<P>BTW:  You could be doing Skyshrine right now.  Absolutely do NOT wait until 50 or half the mobs will be green bud. I'd go now while they are all still blue.  At 49-50 a lot of the lower level spawns will be green.<p>[ October 04, 2001: Message edited by: Lownar/Kalaan/Rakasak ]<P>--------------------<P>Kruunk - 22nd Level Firbolg Hero<BR>Galahad Server<P>Lownar, Kalaan, Rakasak - Retired
</FONT>
